  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive)<br>\n<strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0<br>\n<strong>Fits:</strong> All Weapons without an installed Capacity modifying attachment</p>\n<p>Needs a DV21 Weaponstech check to attach; one per weapon; only on weapons with no Capacity attachment. Adds 1 Attachment Slot that only Capacity attachments can use, and it can combine with other open slots (1 open slot + Flared Magwell fits a 2-slot Belt Box). The extra slot is automated, but the sheet doesn't enforce the Capacity-only restriction.</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Capacity &amp; Reloading).</em></p>"
